    <node id="泰国">
      <data key="d0">泰国</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">传统热门出境游目的地，因治安事件频发导致游客减少。&lt;SEP&gt;Thailand is a traditional international tourism destination that has experienced a decline in Chinese visitors due to safety incidents.</data>
