    <node id="周边游">
      <data key="d0">周边游</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">国内游的新热门选择，源于国外游向国内游的转变。&lt;SEP&gt;周边游refers to short-distance travel around one's home area, which has become a popular new trend in domestic tourism.</data>
      <data key="d3">9df847493a90dc0fe18019acd116c02e-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;9df847493a90dc0fe18019acd116c02e-chunk-005</data>
