      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">国内旅游市场is the domestic tourism market in China that is experiencing structural adjustments and new development opportunities due to the shift from outbound travel.</data>
      <data key="d3">9df847493a90dc0fe18019acd116c02e-chunk-005</data>
